# D-Bus 1.14.10: a newly allocated, unpublished connection is locked under the
# global bus lock during construction. Qt uses dbus_bus_get_private; this new
# mutex cannot be acquired by another thread at that construction edge. TSan
# combines that edge with later disconnect and reports a hypothetical cycle.
# Reproduced with QDBusConnection::sessionBus alone and instrumented libdbus.
# See docs/thread-sanitizer.md. Do not suppress Qt/app races or the lock detector.
deadlock:_dbus_connection_new_for_transport
